  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.9: ELEButton AutoSize property (default true) for auto width based on text/icon content; ELEButton icon integration enhanced with Icon/IconSize/IconPosition/IconSpace properties; ELEIcon expanded to 1000+ icons with ELEIconFont enum (SegoeMDL2/External/Custom), FontName property, RegisterCodePoints() batch registration for iconfont.cn; ELEKeyboard dynamic layout based on Width/Height with Padding/KeyGap/KeyRadius configurable properties, added comma/period keys to full keyboard; ELEDataGridView operation column screen flicker fix",
